pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: Five ground rules. Rule 1 is the one people break first — enforce it kindly but firmly.
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 56, 400, 22]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: GROUND RULES
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 84, 780, 44]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: Five rules for the next three hours
  - elementId: r1n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 168, 56, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      text: "1"
  - elementId: r1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 170, 730, 46]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>Write first, talk second.</strong> Exploration happens in silence — everyone writes events at the same time.</p>
  - elementId: l1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 234, 800, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#E3DDD3"}
  - elementId: r2n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 248, 56, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      text: "2"
  - elementId: r2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 250, 730, 46]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>Events are past tense.</strong> "Order Placed", not "place order". If it hasn't happened, it isn't an event.</p>
  - elementId: l2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 314, 800, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#E3DDD3"}
  - elementId: r3n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 328, 56, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      text: "3"
  - elementId: r3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 330, 730, 54]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>Hotspots, not debates.</strong> Disagreement gets a red note and we move on. We solve them later, with the right people.</p>
  - elementId: l3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 394, 800, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#E3DDD3"}
  - elementId: r4n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 408, 56, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      text: "4"
  - elementId: r4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 410, 730, 54]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>Everyone's notes can move.</strong> Any note may be moved, rewritten, or removed by anyone. No owners on the wall.</p>
  - elementId: l4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 474, 800, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#E3DDD3"}
  - elementId: r5n
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 488, 56, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 40
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      text: "5"
  - elementId: r5
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 490, 730, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: |
        <p><strong>No solutions today.</strong> We map what <em>is</em>. Design ideas go on hotspots for another session.</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [900, 505, 40, 20]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "5"
